WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.230
Confirm your school. Start every task by checking the school and role in the header. This recording uses synthetic Sunshine Academy data.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:26.460
Review what needs attention. Read the dashboard alerts. Identify attendance, enrollment, staffing and compliance items needing a follow-up.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:39.690
Assign the next action. Open the appropriate workspace in normal use. Give each unresolved issue an owner; verify the record after any approved change.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:52.920
Finish the opening review. Check attendance, classroom coverage, kiosk readiness and unread messages. Use the daily routine guide for the closing checklist.

